        "notes": "In my opinion, starting with a lifesteal build is the way to go. Death step in the first 2 rounds does not do much of anything. 92 damage per second (without any buffs) up to a total of 139ish damage over the entire duration. No one is dying to that without luck, lets be honest. Even with a couple of ability power boosts its not worth yet. Instead go for lifesteal primary fire, its much more consistent and you can get a decent set up going for it in round 2. I put the death step stuff as optional if you really want to start that way",
