        "notes": "I know, I know. Why not fill your slots instead of investing in 2 items? Phantasmic Flux is actually just that guy. Very important if you were to go a full lifesteal primary fire build as you double your healing on tp, getting the 100 extra health is super easy after doing so. Other than that, it gives you 10 damage, which is good for getting a bit more lifesteal.\n\nIf somehow you're balling out with 17k plus cash, get as much lifesteal as you can and then fill out as you feel necessary, biggest thing is getting the Phantasmic Flux. If you can only get that then only get that.\n\nIf somehow you cant get 10k then just get normal lifesteal items and then fill as you feel, should be fine. Just play normal reaper with the thought in your mind that you can duel pretty easily after tping",
