        "notes": "Alright, we're going full spin mode now; get ability power and lifesteal. Wreath of ruin is by far the most important item from now on. It will stay there forever. Crowd control is another one I tend to keep the entire time, as having potentially 20% increased damage while also keeping lifesteal is pretty good. \n\nRemember, you are effectively doubling your lifesteal constantly 10% is actually 20%, every ability lifesteal item is so much better than you might think, especially when stacked you are effectively invincible, death stepping into crowds (outside of CC)\n\nIf you are low on money, depending on how low you are get either crowd control only or both greens only (along with wreath obvily). Crowd control is more important though. If you've got a lot of money fill with all the recommended blues in optional, making sure the greens fill it out if you just about cant do it with the blues",
