        "created_at": "2025-07-13T05:48:00.6868+00:00",
        "notes": "More lifesteal, more better, this is the best way to get ult fast, live and be as annoying as possible.\n\nAgain if you can fill with the blues fill with the blues. If you somehow have enough to fill with the blues and still upgrade one of them to a purple, then upgrade Devestation to phantasmic flux.\n\nAlot of people think raw power is the way to go with this kind of thing, but the hard truth is you probably arent killing with death step even if you hard went ability power only, and your ult will wipe teams regardless of if it has 40% increased damage or 80%. This means ability lifesteal is sooo much more valuable than people think. It will keep you above 1k healing and farm a ton of ult charge. More than what you can get with Catalytic Crystal.\n\nTo drive this home even more think about this: if you reach 100% ability power you will have enough damage for your death steps to equal a regular non-buffed reaper ult. You would be doing 185/s. Sounds decent but it really is nothing because it lasts 1.5seconds. You once again are not going to be killing anything in later rounds. Your ult would be crazy yes, but you don't need to buff it that much because it lasts longer. You will still wipe players with 75% ability power in later rounds with your ult. Not worth",
