        "created_at": "2025-07-13T05:48:00.6868+00:00",
        "notes": "This is it. This is, in my opinion the best you can get with the spin build. \"But wait, why arent you upgrading everything to all purples?\" Ill explain:\n\nFirst off, there are no ability healing purple items aside from phantasmic flux. I experimented with other survivability purples, yes even Lumerico Fusion Drive, and no none of them shine a candle to 20% ability lifesteal instead. Maybe take those if you're getting anti nade spammed, but in my opinion even in the high ranks I rarely ever see Anas do that and its easy to wait it out\n\nYour ult will still kill and going for more ability power loses more than you gain. Again I tested this time and time again, no one dies even if you full lean into AP, healing reduction, move speed reduction, they all didn't kill and so I decided it was just way more valuable to make your spins unkillable instead, while also giving you insane ult charge from not only the damage but the healing as well, allowing your ult to do the work.\n\nIn my experience it takes 3-5 tps to get your ult (if you're not solo death stepping every time). Once you have it you can team wipe with ease. Youll deal roughly 1138 dmg overall with your ult if you ult all 5 enemies and you're above 80% (the latter will always happen), enough to kill all squishes and most tanks without the need to go full AP, WHILE keeping 90% lifesteal (multiplied by each character in your ult/death step btw). Broken and no one knows about it because no one cares about lifesteal/ they keep ulting/Death stepping into CC.\n\nSolo ults (only one person inside of radius) = 1048 damage overall, still enough to kill any squishie and get any tank to 100hp (why are you solo ulting a tank tho)\n\nthe optional is just in case you still don't have enough money. If you don't have enough though you're probably doing something wrong/youre getting ultra countered",
